.
.  Generate sample output for Beta PDF plot
.
device 1 x11
device 1 font simplex
set ipl1na bet1pdf.jpg
device 2 gd jpeg
device 2 picture points 100 75
.
TITLE CASE ASIS
TITLE Beta(0.5,0.5) PDF
TITLE SIZE 3
LABEL SIZE 3
LABEL CASE ASIS
TIC LABEL SIZE 3
Y1LABEL Probability Density
X1LABEL X
.
PLOT BETPDF(X,0.5,0.5) FOR X = 0.01 0.01 0.99
.
box 0 0 100 100
.
device 2 close
system mv bet1pdf.jpg ../gif100/bet1pdf.jpg
.
quit
